BAR Droid phone version of BAR's Notifications (luaui/widgets/snd_notifications.lua): its table of "unit is ready"
voice lines read each unit's id as UnitDefNames.<name>.id, and a game whose options take a unit out (an online host's
restriction: no Behemoth, corjugg, on Kailil's Fold7 2026-11-21 01:04) has no such entry: "attempt to index field
'corjugg' (a nil value)", and the whole widget failed to load, no voice notifications that game (BAR's own Legion lines
in the same table already ask "UnitDefNames.x and UnitDefNames.x.id"). Each looked up that way now; and the Scavengers'
copy of the table read entry [1] for every entry and failed the same way on a unit taken out. Applied by the engine
(BarDroidPhoneLuaDir) to BAR's file as LuaUI loads it; if a block finds no place, BAR's own file runs.
For BAR: docs/upstream/bar-notifications-missing-units.patch.

